WEBVTT

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:07.720
Oh yes, this one, this and this one too.

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:11.120
I'll bring this one too. Alright.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:22.950
Now... Winter days have got to be spent eating tangerines!

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:18.400
Alright, let me get some soccer in before I head home.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.890
Bad news, Makoto-kun.

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:22.780
What's the matter, Uchida?

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.600
I don't know the reason but,

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:28.410
Chiaki and Touma look like they are having a fight.

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:32.080
I won't say a word again.

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:33.570
Me too.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:35.360
Unforgivable.

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:36.330
Me too.

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:42.380
Stop them, Makoto-kun.

00:01:42.590 --> 00:01:43.920
Do something!

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:44.700
Eh?

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:48.610
Makoto-kun...

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:53.760
Ok!

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:55.040
Makoto-kun!

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.540
I'm going to head out for baseball. Solve this problem on your own.

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:03.950
Listen carefully Uchida... Don't think too highly of me.

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:07.570
Do you really think I can stop them from fighting?

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:12.240
And so, I'll be heading out to play some dodge ball.

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:14.030
So in the end where are you going?

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:18.020
Speaking of which, they have been unhappy since this morning.

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:21.020
Although they may not look like happy people normally...

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:22.030
Even more than usual...

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.180
Since this morning?

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:30.360
Uchida, it's quite possible they started arguing since yesterday.

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:31.620
Since yesterday?

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.280
Yesterday, Touma went over to Minami's house.

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:36.880
Something happened there.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:40.860
Let's go ask Kana. She might know something.

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:43.570
Uchida, let's go to the Minami's place now.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:44.830
O-ok.

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:49.900
I felt that such a thing might happen and always have my transformation set ready!

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:53.110
I really can't tell if he's dependable or if he's useless at this point.

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:57.120
Even if you plead, I won't say a word again.

00:02:57.330 --> 00:02:58.090
Same here.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.640
We agree a lot, you idiot.

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:04.470
I didn't know that fellow was so stingy.

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:06.690
Really, idiot.

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:09.920
I won't ever talk to that fellow again.

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:16.410
Oh, you guys came over.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.740
Let me tell you now, Haruka will be back late today.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:25.940
Makoto-kun, erm I mean Mako-chan please show some enthusiasm.

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:31.690
I see, so Chiaki and Touma are fighting.

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:34.920
Sorry, but I don't know the reason either.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:38.440
But, arguments shall be encouraged.

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:43.470
A puppy learns its limits from fighting amongst its siblings.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:49.770
But I'm not that childish to argue with Chiaki.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:54.230
I feel there is always an unfair battle going on though.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:22.870
Well when you look at it, we were also at fault.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:24.400
Why?

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:29.300
Kana and I usually pick our own tangerines from the box.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:30.810
I understand.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.820
Same as at my place. We buy in boxes too.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:37.740
I didn't feel like getting out of the kotatsu, that's why I took Kana's tangerine.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.800
I took it without saying anything, that wasn't right either.

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:44.880
But, it's not something that you should get truly angry about.

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:46.400
It's not very mature.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:50.690
Anyway, we are more mature so let's go apologise.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:51.940
Yeah.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:54.000
I'm back.

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:55.250
Afternoon~

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.420
What was that? Kana is so stingy!

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:58.740
That's true!

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.380
What did you say?

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.360
Why can't you let us take just 1 tangerine?

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:02.730
It's mine, return it!
Why can't you let us take just 1 tangerine?

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:03.490
Hey, Kana..
It's mine, return it!

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:03.950
It's mine, return it!

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.210
What did you say?
It's mine, return it!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:10.180
It's just only one. It's nothing big.

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:12.010
Just let me have this!

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.030
That's my tangerine!

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.150
Hey, Kana...

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:31.680
You idiot!

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:32.820
What's up with you, Chiaki?

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:34.990
Getting angry like this, it's not mature!

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:37.090
I wonder whose mouth this is coming from.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.710
Hey Chiaki, are you sewing?  That's unusual for you.

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:23.050
What are you making?

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:25.420
What's that?

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:27.330
It's a sock.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:29.570
It's huge. Who is it for?

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:31.970
It's for Santa.

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:41.050
Hey Haruka, what are you going to do about Kana and Chiaki's presents this year?

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:45.150
Kana has already said what she wants...

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.940
But Chiaki won't reveal what she wants.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:49.580
What should I do?

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:52.250
That's because telling Haruka about it won't help.

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:54.830
Because the present is from Santa.

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:02.650
Well, the reason why Fujioka-kun is here, is...

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:07.630
To consult you, considering you made Chiaki happy with your Christmas present before.

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:08.910
Oh...

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:12.450
Fujioka was a success.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:13.890
That...

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:18.550
About Chiaki... She just doesn't want to say what she wants for Christmas.

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:23.490
Yesterday, Chiaki brought back a really big sock.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.390
What's the matter, Chiaki? Did something good happen?

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:39.340
Yep, I finally finished it.

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:44.730
Say, Chiaki...

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:48.740
Preparing such a big sock, what do you want from Santa?

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.480
No, nothing much.

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:54.350
Just give us a hint...

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:57.450
Anything is fine, idiot.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:01.970
I see.

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:05.470
This is the sock in question.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:06.800
What is that?

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:09.300
Ah, I see. It's a sock.

00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:13.570
A present that could fit inside this sock, I can't imagine it at all.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:18.160
I am perturbed by this. Such a greedy person.

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:22.370
I don't remember raising Chiaki to be such a greedy person.

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:23.730
Not like we-.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:24.490
It's just like that.

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:26.540
Erm...

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:32.440
It's early but, here are presents for all 3 of you.

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:33.430
Haruka-san.

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:35.560
Please,

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:37.860
Thanks! Fujioka-kun.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.220
Here, Mi-Minami...

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:42.940
Sorry about that~ Thank you~!

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:46.320
Can we open it?

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:47.880
Ah, please do.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:54.130
Ah! It's a glove, can I keep it?

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:56.970
What's that? Oh, it's a glove.

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:01.270
Isn't it fine?

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:03.050
To just put that present inside the sock.

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:06.980
Isn't this enough?

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:08.670
Erm, but...

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:11.230
Maybe something else would be...

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:12.680
Yeah, Kana.

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:16.310
For such a big sock to only to have 1 glove is a little sad.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:18.100
No need to worry.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:22.380
Dreams and reality, both can be made true.

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:53.510
Morning.

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:03.850
Morning, what's with you?

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:09.300
Hiding inside this sock, I was thinking of catching Santa when he came.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.720
But I dosed off and it became morning.

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:13.680
Don't lie, you idiot.

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:17.750
If you have been there since last night, you would have caught a cold long ago.

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:22.510
Eh? I thought you might be angrier.

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:24.330
No, not really.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.750
But look Chiaki,

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:28.340
it seems that Santa did come.

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:44.270
Hey, Chiaki.

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:46.970
What is the matter Haruka-neesama

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:51.090
What did you really want as a present?

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.690
Nothing much...

00:11:57.630 --> 00:12:01.440
To prepare such a big sock, you wanted something big right?

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:06.120
I left the present to Santa's senses.

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:12.070
So that anything could fit, that's why I made such a big sock.

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:14.740
Then, you are satisfied with that?

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:17.640
Of course.

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:22.690
Eh? I see.

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:27.170
They're warm, these gloves.

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:29.750
Yeah. I see.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:48.100
Natsuki.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.610
Today is the 25th,

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:53.910
the afternoon of the 25th.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:13:00.660
That is to say, the present that is supposed to be beside Touma's pillow is here.

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:02.060
It's because of you!

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:09.510
If you are not going to eat it, I'll throw that away.

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:10.970
Eh. Sorry!

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:15.770
Wait that's not right, I should be the one that's angry.

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:17.670
Hey, Touma...

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:21.310
How was this year's present?

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:29.130
Every year, there's a very random present beside my pillow.

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:30.610
I see...

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:31.660
And?

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:34.470
I was wondering when was it going to continue until...

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:35.910
And it's finally over.

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.220
I-I see...

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:41.850
Isn't that a bit sad?

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:45.260
It's fine, since it's never anything I want anyway.

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:51.430
Touma, I'm ready.

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:57.110
Ah, Haruka. Thanks for the tea.

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:59.490
We are heading out, Haruka-neesama.

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:02.710
Ok. Take care Chiaki, Touma.

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:15.110
Brother, phone call from Haruka-san.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:18.780
Natsuki-kun.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:21.970
You didn't prepare a present for Touma?

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.340
It was prepared but...

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:25.690
But I couldn't place it yesterday.

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:28.370
Why? Why didn't you place it?

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.510
Erm that's because...

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:33.320
She wasn't in her room last night.

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:34.890
Why wasn't she in her room?

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.410
Erm that's because yesterday...

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:52.810
We got dead serious playing video games in my room.

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:55.830
I totally forgot about the present.

00:14:57.370 --> 00:15:00.910
But since Touma is about to reach an age where she doesn't need presents...

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:02.500
I was thinking this year would be fine.

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:07.060
After asking me "what should I get for the present" and then deciding on your own to give up...

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:09.850
Tonight! Tonight, I will put it beside her pillow!

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:12.790
Alright, you must do it.

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:14.040
Bye.

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:40.990
Ok.

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:51.070
I'm back.

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:54.560
Hey, Natsuki.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:18.920
Yes, I win!

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:20.450
That was cheap!

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:21.820
I'm back.

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:24.490
Oh, welcome ba-

00:16:26.530 --> 00:16:27.070
That.

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:31.480
I saw it on the pillow, I saw it was there.

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:33.410
I didn't notice in the morning.

00:16:38.570 --> 00:16:39.300
Touma.

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:42.470
No, that's impossible.

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:44.380
I left it in the living room just now.

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:45.920
Wait, brother.

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:48.210
I left it in the living room and I forgot about it.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.570
It isn't possible to have it beside your pillow.

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:53.710
I was trying to be nice to you!

00:16:55.350 --> 00:17:00.080
I see, she was very happy with the contents of the present.

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:04.570
Why has the present, that's supposed to be beside the pillow tonight, already been opened?

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:40.150
Hey, Haruka.

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:40.970
Hmm?

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:44.350
What are you going to do about Kana and Chiaki's presents this year?

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:47.420
Kana has already said what she wanted...

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:49.900
But Chiaki won't reveal what she wants.

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:52.160
What should I do?

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:54.650
That's because telling Haruka about it won't help.

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:56.850
Because the present is from Santa.

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:01.840
Christmas present, huh.

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:06.210
When you talk about Christmas presents, it must be Santa.

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:08.970
Oh, Natsuki.

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:10.360
Hosaka-sempai.

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:14.750
Natsuki, what do you think of Santa?

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:17.510
It's dream-like.

00:19:18.350 --> 00:19:20.070
What do you think of a Santa who passes out dreams?

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:22.460
I think it's great.

00:19:23.590 --> 00:19:23.920
I see.

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:25.800
Yep.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:43.910
How is it?

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:47.690
Would you like to order one of our Christmas cakes?

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:53.050
Please.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:11.290
Welcome!

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:14.530
Oh my... Such a cute guy, I'll have one.

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:15.220
Thanks.

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:17.370
Me too.

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:18.540
Thanks!

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:23.640
If I do this, Minami Haruka will eventually...

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.410
Here everyone, buy it here.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:47.450
If it's bad, you can return it.

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:50.160
Why, come and taste it.

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:52.010
Come ~ please.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.800
Th-This is...

00:21:01.880 --> 00:21:04.280
Give me a Christmas cake please.

00:21:09.050 --> 00:21:09.570
Huh?

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:11.240
Oh no...

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:32.110
Take this.

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:36.590
It's a present from Santa Claus.

00:21:41.210 --> 00:21:43.540
B-but.

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:15.700
Hey, what are you doing?

00:22:20.780 --> 00:22:22.470
What's with that crowd?

00:22:22.470 --> 00:22:24.040
It looks like a cake shop.

00:22:24.160 --> 00:22:25.410
Ah, cake!

00:22:25.590 --> 00:22:27.520
Hey! Haruka, let's buy one.

00:22:28.050 --> 00:22:28.850
No.

00:22:29.670 --> 00:22:32.260
Even though it's Christmas...

00:22:35.240 --> 00:22:36.780
It has already been prepared.

00:22:36.880 --> 00:22:37.580
Really?

00:22:37.740 --> 00:22:39.270
As expected of Haruka-neesama

00:22:39.270 --> 00:22:40.520
Let's hurry home!

00:22:40.520 --> 00:22:44.540
That was for sale! The cream is flying everywhere!

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:44.880
Children, I am Santa!
That was for sale! The cream is flying everywhere!

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:46.810
Children, I am Santa!

00:22:49.980 --> 00:22:52.380
Merry Christmas

00:22:52.380 --> 00:22:54.440
Everyone, eat up!

00:22:54.850 --> 00:22:56.370
OK!

00:23:19.110 --> 00:23:20.290
Now, come! Minami Haruka!

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:20.680
Hey you, go wash your face!
Now, come! Minami Haruka!

00:23:20.680 --> 00:23:22.240
Hey you, go wash your face!

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:32.340
Brother, who were you talking to?

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:33.330
Haruka-senpai.

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:37.890
Touma seems happy with the present.

00:23:38.670 --> 00:23:40.560
Next time on Minami-ke Okaeri.

00:23:40.970 --> 00:23:41.650
On Your Attitude.

00:23:42.200 --> 00:23:43.870
What will you do next year?
